Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:56:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(examples): scientific citation extraction profile
 and graph script

Add an entity extraction profile for scientific articles (Paper, Author,
Venue, Identifier, Methodology, Dataset, Concept, Claim) with a controlled
relationship vocabulary (cites, supports, authored_by, ...) aimed at
verifying the relevance of cited references. The versioned copy lives in
prompts/samples/ because prompts/entity_type/ is gitignored.

examples/scientific_citation_kg.py installs the profile, enforces the
schema through kg_extraction_validator, ingests text files, and offers a
--graph-only mode (NoopVectorDBStorage, no embeddings) for corpus
backfills followed by lightrag-rebuild-vdb.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
